WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.520
Dero Dero Dero Saim!

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.950
I hear CelePara are having a valentine's party!

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:11.590
However, according to the Aroma Prophecy, that day is a Witches Sabbath-dearu.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.530
As the prophecy states, we shall have our sabbath

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.410
and send those innocent girls to hell-dearu!

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:22.550
Sabato? Why are we talking about fish all of a sudden?

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.670
Lala, that's "Saba".

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.570
A Sabbath is when witches gather-pri.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:28.800
A Gathering?

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.290
At UndPara, we'll have an event in order to

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:35.750
get a lot of guests and beat CelePara-nano!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.860
We will greatly celebrate Walpriparagis Nacht!

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.850
Give me your soul!

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.220
Garuru!

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.980
The girl with the sharp fangs, I shall allow you to speak.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.540
Garuru agrees-garu.

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.840
Garuru was lonely.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.910
But I'm not anymore because everyone is here.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.250
Garuru.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.150
I want more friends!

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.080
Very well-dearu!

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:10.240
Part of my soul returned to me, so I too am greatly happy...

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.430
Forget I said that-dearu!

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:14.290
Demon cancel it-dearu!

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:18.270
You meant to say you're happy Mikan came back, didn't you?

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:21.970
Don't make any more jokes or you'll burn in hell fire-dearu!

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.560
You're not honest with your feelings-pri.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:28.450
F-Feeling aren't important for demons.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.050
Pri! I have a good idea-pri!

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.070
Let's throw a celebration even CelePara can't ignore-pri!

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.300
On Valentin...

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.040
No, Devitime day.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:42.290
There will be the 21st Demon Revolution,
Devil Revolution 666-dearu.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.800
How's about it Leona? Let's do it!

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.070
Yeah, Dorothy you're rearing to go!

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:49.250
Yeah, let's do lots of concerts and snap pritickets!

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:51.150
I'll hand out flyers-pri!

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:53.300
I'll put up posters!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.880
I'll decorate the stage!

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.960
I'll make teeth marks!

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.420
Let's give it our all! All for one, one for all!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.660
All for one, one for all!

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:04.800
Ei Ei Capisce!

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.190
You're all over the show-dearu...

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:14.720
Anyway, I've grown to like you-dearu.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:17.390
Want to enter the pits of hell together?

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:18.310
Garu?

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.760
She's asking you if you want to do it together.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:22.950
Garuru and Aromageddon...

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.240
GARUMAGEDDON

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.620
I'll do it!
GARUMAGEDDON

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.920
Okay, then let us snap-dearu.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.460
Or so I thought, but you can't, can you-dearu?

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.810
But we're all together regardless-nano!

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.410
Exactly-dearu!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.120
Yay!

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:41.480
Garumageddon is born!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.980
Garumageddon's
Devitine's Day

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.680
The CelePara Valentine Party is underway!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:33.100
A wonderful party on Valentine's Day.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.240
I'll chocolate to you all.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:38.640
And I'll feed it to you.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:42.300
Open wide.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.480
Being fed by Hibiki-sama!

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.680
I'm gonna faint!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.760
I'll give you chocolate too!

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:56.820
I will create the best chocolate for CelePara to make it a paradise.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.720
In order to enjoy the flavor to it's maximum.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:03.130
I suggest you don't eat any chocolate until Valentine's day!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.160
We won't!

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.400
There's so many acorns-nekon!

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.930
I'll be able to bake delicious bread with them-nekon.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.080
Ah, now that you mention it it's almost Valentines Day-kuma.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.090
Nekon?

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:12.870
Ah, now that you mention it it's almost Valentines Day-kuma.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.080
He's right-usa!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.370
What a coincidence.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.840
I was given these chocolate glasses by Leona last year.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:23.860
Why are you so desperate for chocolate-nekon?

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:30.090
Just two cute fluffballs and a cute four eyes-nekon.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.340
Head Disciplinarian Minami, what day do you think the 14th is?

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:38.650
Those strange people persecuted by the Roman Emperor...

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.720
I know where Valentine's Day came from.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.750
But I won't be giving chocolate, so I don't need to be given any.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.600
Now is not the time for puns

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.110
or catchphrases!

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.170
I've got to try harder

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:54.250
and reach the summit of idoldom!

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:57.240
Head Disciplinarian Minami...

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:01.130
She recognized me!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.400
This is the schedule for spring break.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.340
That is all.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.110
Well done.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:14.210
This calls for a spot of the finest tea, Amber Dreams.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.360
I expect nothing less of you, Ando.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:18.540
Thanks for the lovely tea.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.940
Are you enjoying UndPara?

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.940
Let me participate in the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix.

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:27.900
In the Spring Dream Gran Prix?

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.730
When someone from UndPara becomes top idol,

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.560
they might be able to rival the Dream Team.

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.810
This is also a revolution.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:41.680
Revolution, my favorite word.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.220
But only prodigies can overthrow,

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:48.460
when the commoners attempt, it only ends in violence.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.660
Even if it comes to that though,

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.870
I'll allow you to enter.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.220
It's meaningless because it's impossible, but I'll let you do it anyway

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.650
Thank you very much-pu

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.360
Pri!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.030
Hibiki-sama!

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.130
Are you okay!?

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.020
Ha ha...

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:11.460
W-what an interesting girl...

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.470
I'll give it my all to increase my rank-pri!

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.820
Aim higher-pri!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.760
Have a parade-pri!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.070
Allow me to take your empty glasses-kuma.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.860
How about seconds-usa?

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:58.930
We even have hot pot-nekon!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:05.610
It's of great importance for the CelePara Valentine's party to be a success.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.470
We gave out so many flyers...

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:13.780
We put up posters too-nano...

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.310
Yet despite all that...

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.150
Nobody came-dearu.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.080
Everyone went to the CelePara party.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.800
It's a shame-garu.

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:30.060
To lose so crushingly on the dawn of our revolution,

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.440
is such a humiliation-pri...

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.000
What do we do now Aroma?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.230
This was your idea after all.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:37.660
Think of something!

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.930
I don't want to be a loser!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.030
Or even worse, a loser ninja!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:44.640
How about a loser angel-nano?

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.800
What should we do...

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:50.410
Bugs?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.670
Bugs, bugs...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.890
Just <i>bee</i> ourselves.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:56.800
Err no...

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:57.770
Bugs...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.400
Ah!

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.950
I have just received a prophecy-dearu!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:08.000
A new volume of the Aroma Prophecy is here!

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:12.540
Small devils will infiltrate and exhaust the giant-dearu!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.120
Garumageddon, move out-dearu!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.070
Okay-nano!

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:18.980
Garu!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.130
What?

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.280
Capisce?

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.480
As bugs crowding around chocolate,

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.940
we shall eat every last drop-dearu.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:39.180
Chocolate is so yummy! So yummy!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.730
Delicious-garurururu...

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.650
I will lead all the disappointed peasants

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:50.490
to the gates of hell and bring about walpriparanacht-dearu!

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:54.880
She means she'll bring all the girls to UndPara-nano!

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.930
Nice, as expected from a devil-garu!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.760
Devi!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.780
I thought of such an amazing plan!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:05.560
Based on the feared Aroma Prophecy!

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:08.500
The devil will eat all your chocolate!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.560
Devi, Devi!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.550
Here you go, Princess Falulu.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:28.660
Thanks Maho-chan, I'm so happy to get a chocolate unicorn.

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.590
And for Shion.

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:31.990
I don't need it.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.800
Don't say that...

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:37.520
They're sweet white and bitter dark chocolate.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.490
Go chocolate!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.430
"Repaying the favor"

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.000
I'm thankful that we're on the same team.

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.840
"One and only"

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.520
I don't need them, but I'm glad, so I'll take them.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.890
I'm glad you're happy.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.020
And for Sophie.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.690
Plum chocolate.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:02.020
Mixing red flash with chocolate?

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:04.080
And for Piyonce.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.030
What happened to Piyonce?

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:10.030
Piyonce is getting married,

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.540
so she retired from the Dream Team.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:16.750
I see.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.870
In that case, send her some wedding chocolate.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:21.910
Ando.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:24.420
Thank you very much.

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:26.800
This is the second time this year.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.600
I'm so jealous!

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:33.240
It's your turn next!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.610
I'll feed you all chocolate!

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:44.430
And now, to present the best chocolate ever!

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:45.820
5,

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:46.880
5, 4,

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:47.930
5, 4, 3,

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:48.800
5, 4, 3, 2,

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:49.540
5, 4, 3, 2, 1!

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:54.990
It's all gone!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.390
Devi Devi.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.710
Thanks for the treat-nano!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.170
Garu!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:02.960
Chocolate?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.520
What's chocolate?

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.320
As if you'd forget!

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.670
You said you'd give us chocolate!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.470
I even went without chocolate!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.140
So mean!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.140
I'm so disappointed.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:17.180
By the way, they're having a Valentine's event at UndPara-nekon!

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:21.070
There's plenty of chocolate and fun concerts there-usa!

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.900
Did you hear that?

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.190
Let's go!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.030
Let's go to UndPara!

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:35.760
Wow Aroma-chan, you're amazing!

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:38.750
I eat tasks like this before I curse my breakfast-dearu!

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.710
What did you do?

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.920
Devi Devi, it's a secret-dearu!

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.870
You've got chocolate all around your mouth-pri.

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:50.940
Scan the mytickets required for your cord.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.700
You can scan your friendtickets too.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.830
Cord change start!

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:02.880
A sweet cord with heart chocolate.

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:06.210
Using chocolate brown as the cords accent.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.660
Valentine caramel cord!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.610
Devi!

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:13.680
With a heart-shaped backpack on,

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:17.100
please give everyone sweet chocolate.

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:19.320
Valentine heart cord!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.680
Darkness!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.400
Be cursed, demonic followers!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:38.890
Shining, be blessed holy followers-nano!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:40.810
Aroma and Mikan!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.800
Angel and Devil

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:46.120
and the fanged one!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.340
Garuru!

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:52.240
Abandon hope, all ye who enter PriPara!

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.490
Nope,

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.990
we'll take you to heaven!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.460
No, to hell.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.800
Aromageddon and

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.700
Garuru!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.840
Devil, angel, fangs, assimilate!

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:07.050
Together we're Garomageddon!

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:46.760
Where are we?

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:49.120
Garuru's house-nano!

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.160
Garu!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:52.090
Oh!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.620
Garu!

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.620
Together with Garuru-nano!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.040
Devi Devi!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.300
Come on in-nano!

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:09.840
Welcome to My Sweet Happy Room!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:55.600
Nice Garumageddon!

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:57.370
Give it all you've got!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.280
Thanks!

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.480
I'll give you chocolate!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:02.160
Let's snap it-pri!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:03.840
Keep it coming-pri!

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:05.290
Snap chocolate with me!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.350
I'm so glad I'm getting more fans!

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:08.360
Right Leona?

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.880
Yes, if Dorothy says so!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.100
Let's snap chocolate!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.800
Chocolate is tasty-nano!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.760
Garuru Garuru!

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:20.580
Let's aim higher-pri!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.080
It's a revolution-pri!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.270
Sugar Cube Capisce!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.880
Walpriparagis nacht was a roaring success-dearu!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.900
Let them do as they please.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.920
The spirit of the revolution is there.

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:38.170
It'll be something to talk about, at least.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.720
I wonder what to do about replacing Piyonce.

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:44.160
Should I get Padonna?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.940
Or Lady Papa?

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:50.430
Cake Perry or Paylor Swift?

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.350
Who are you?

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:57.510
I asked, who are you?

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.800
I'm the truth.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.520
Leona West...

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.830
I'll get it.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.300
This is Shikyouin.

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:17.530
Curly-chan?

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.830
It's been so long!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:37.330
How nostalgic!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:41.660
The fruits of our hometown are so delicious,

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.390
do you remember oranges?

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.390
Those times were so fun!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.120
Huh?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.850
There's no reply, can you hear me?

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:54.890
Can you hear me? Hello?

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:58.420
Let's hang out when I get back to Parajuku!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:01.540
Let's go!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.440
(Ajimi noises)

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:07.760
You've suffered a lot

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:11.260
I can help you, we can have fun again!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.640
C-Curly-chan?

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:27.380
Kiki Ajimi, could you be...

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.400
Ando!!

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:33.050
Put up a barricade!

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.350
Don't let Kiki Ajimi close to me!

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:39.030
I want nothing, <i>nothing</i> to do with her!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.490
TL note: Nothing to do and European Pear are homophones (younashi)

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.100
Give me back my chocolate!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:47.950
You speak of a revolution!?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:51.990
Coming along with me while I made such a sweet face!

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:55.610
My sweetness ends here! I will have no mercy!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:20:00.350
Strength crushes weakness, it's written in the history books!

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.830
Crush the revolution!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:11.640
Hibiki-sama's days of sweetness are coming to an end.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.880
It looks like a storm is brewing.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:22.840
I have cavities-dearu. They hurt-dearu.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.820
Garuru...

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:28.140
Is this punishment for eating what wasn't ours?

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.040
I'm fine-nano!

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:34.270
Even devils have to reflect on their actions-dearu...

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:36.180
By they way I got,

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.150
chocolate glasses from Leona this year too.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.460
My sweet mask, just got sweeter.
